{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being the new buddy to some of your new found &quot;friends&quot;, you can't help but wonder: Can you really trust them? Is this part of a elaborate scheme? and what exactly is a Frob? Frob: The Incident follows you through with a fairly short but immersive journey where you're forced to stay put in a room while you ponder your purpose. Yet you at least have one answer to your numerous questions: &quot;who will stop this madness?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for? For us to tell you that is a 3D survival horror game that has various features such as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Cutscenes</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023500/extras/95c695151bd63ee0d851880abc278791.poster.avif?t=1758393964\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023500/extras/95c695151bd63ee0d851880abc278791.webm?t=1758393964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023500/extras/95c695151bd63ee0d851880abc278791.mp4?t=1758393964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Cameras</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023500/extras/7a4bbd4a594337dfa68d155765b7e645.poster.avif?t=1758393964\" width=1170 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023500/extras/7a4bbd4a594337dfa68d155765b7e645.webm?t=1758393964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s